            "speaker": "Bhagat Singh",
            "context": "Ferozeshah Kotla Debate, September 8, 1928 (reported by Shiv Verma)",
            "text": "If we fight merely to place Indian capitalists on the throne vacated by British bureaucrats, then the condition of our laborers and peasants will remain identical. Our goal is Socialism—the total liberation of the working masses."
